WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.112
Section 6.

00:00:02.062 --> 00:00:06.162
Foreign Interference — the jurisdiction nobody owns.

00:00:06.162 --> 00:00:11.187
CSIS collects intelligence on foreign interference but cannot lay charges.

00:00:11.187 --> 00:00:15.337
The RCMP can lay charges but lacks intelligence.

00:00:15.337 --> 00:00:18.362
Neither agency has clear authority.

00:00:18.362 --> 00:00:23.362
The result: Chinese police stations operated openly in Canada.

00:00:23.362 --> 00:00:27.487
The RCMP investigation closed without charges.
